### 2. Pennsylvania Roads Shapefile (`data/tl_2019_42_prisecroads/tl_2019_42_prisecroads.shp`)

| Property | Value |
|---|---|
| **File Type** | Vector (LineString) |
| **CRS** | **EPSG:4269** (NAD83) |
